269: **Data flow:**
270: 1. User selects date via `CalendarStrip` or `WeekBoard` → `setSelectedDate` → all sections reload
271: 2. User toggles goal → `handleToggle` → optimistically updates `goals` + `weekGoals` → `confetti` → API save → `loadWeek()` refreshes `WeekBoard`
272: 3. User links schedule block to goal → `updateScheduleEntry` → block color changes → `GoalCard` shows "Scheduled" badge
273: 4. User adds reminder with due date → `createReminder` → `DeadlineRadar` gets new mark → `CalendarStrip` gets new dot
274: 5. User completes all goals → `ReflectionCard` prompts "You sealed all N goals — what felt most impactful?"
