447: ### 6.2 CalendarStrip (Enhanced)
448: 
449: **New props:**
450: ```ts
451: interface CalendarStripProps {
452:   selectedDate: string;
453:   onDateChange: (date: string) => void;
454:   marks?: Map<string, { color: string; label: string }[]>;  // NEW
455:   weekGoals?: Record<string, Goal[]>;  // NEW
456: }
457: ```
458: 
459: **Dot logic per date:**
460: ```ts
461: function getDotsForDate(dateStr: string, weekGoals?: Record<string, Goal[]>, marks?: Map<string, RadarMark[]>): Dot[] {
462:   const dots: Dot[] = [];
463: 
464:   // Goal category dots (max 2)
465:   const dayGoals = weekGoals?.[dateStr] || [];
466:   const categories = [...new Set(dayGoals.map(g => g.category))];
467:   categories.slice(0, 2).forEach(cat => {
468:     dots.push({ color: catDot(cat), shape: 'circle' });
469:   });
470: 
471:   // Deadline marks (diamond)
472:   const dayMarks = marks?.get(dateStr) || [];
473:   dayMarks.forEach(m => {
474:     if (dots.length < 3) dots.push({ color: m.color, shape: 'diamond' });
475:   });
476: 
477:   return dots;
478: }
479: ```
480: 
481: **Styling:** Dots are `w-1 h-1` with `0.5` gap. Diamond uses `rotate-45`. Rendered in a flex row beneath the day number.
