87: - **Chips/tags** — hairline border, mono 11 uppercase. Phase chips add the
88:   hue as a 6px dot or 2px left bar — never a filled pill.
89: - **Tabs** — mono labels; active = text-hi + 2px white underline.
90: - **Tables/lists** — hairline row separators, 36–44px rows, hover white@4%,
91:   selected = signal@12% bg + 2px left signal bar. No zebra striping.
92: - **Tooltips** — bg-2, hairline, mono 11, 250ms delay.
93: - **Modals** — scrim rgba(0,0,0,.6) (no blur), panel 480–640px, focus trap,
94:   Esc closes.
95: - **Toasts** — bottom-right, bg-2 + hairline; destructive success MUST
96:   offer Undo.
97: - **Skeletons** — white@6% blocks; no shimmer loops in data views.
98: - **Empty states** — mono message + one texture flourish (§10) + the single
99:   primary action. Empty is a designed moment, not a blank panel.
100: 
101: ## §6 DATA-VIZ
102: - Chart chrome monochrome: axes/labels mono 10px text-low, gridlines
103:   white@4%, no shadows, no 3D, no gradient fills (area fills per §2.2.3).
104: - Series colors ONLY from the phase palette. Categorical mapping is GLOBAL —
105:   "deep work" is the same blue in every chart, every page, forever.
106: - Line strokes 1.5px white for primary series; secondary series use palette
107:   hues. Playheads/scrubbers: white dot + bloom.
108: 
109: ## §7 MOTION
110: - The app runs all day: **no infinite ambient loops.** Textures are static
111:   (§10). Boot animation plays once. Battery is a design constraint.
112: - Durations: 80 (hover) / 140 (micro) / 200 (transition) / 320 (panel) ms.
113:   Ease: cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1); exits ease-in (0.7,0,0.84,0).
114: - Springs ONLY for scrub/scrubbed interactions (timeline playhead):
115:   stiffness 120, damping 25.
116: - Everything scroll/scrub-bound is REVERSIBLE (pure function of progress).
117: - `prefers-reduced-motion`: render final states instantly. Non-negotiable.
118: 
119: ## §8 ICONOGRAPHY & IMAGERY
120: - Icons: lucide only, 1.5px stroke, 16/20px. Filled variants only for
121:   active state. No emoji as UI. One icon set, ever.
122: - No illustrations, no stock photos, no 3D clipart, no marketing renders
123:   inside the product. Surfaces and data ARE the visual interest.
124: 
125: ## §9 STATES & FORGIVENESS (per Human-Centric UX law)
126: - Every data surface defines FOUR states: empty / loading / error /
127:   populated. Shipping three is a bug.
128: - Errors: danger left-bar + human sentence + mono error id for support.
129: - Destructive actions: confirm OR undo — always a path back. (Time can't
130:   rewind; the UI must.)
131: - Progressive disclosure: density is a choice; advanced controls collapse.
132: 
133: ## §10 THEME SYSTEM (the licensed variation)
134: Schema — themes may ONLY set these keys:
135: ```json
136: { "signal": "deepwork|learning|neutral|…", "texture": "ruler|grid|ascii|ridgeline|none",
137:   "textureOpacity": 0.02–0.04, "density": "compact|comfortable" }
138: - **Textures (static, pre-rendered, never animated in-app):**
139:   `ruler` vertical tick hairlines · `grid` 24px dot grid white@4% ·
140:   `ascii` sparse glyph field @2–3% · `ridgeline` bottom-edge waves @8% ·
141:   `none`.
142: - **Registry (◇ provisional — finalize after design_audit):**
143:   | Surface | signal | texture | density |
144:   |---|---|---|---|
145:   | Record/Dashboard | deepwork | ruler | compact |
146:   | Learn | learning | grid | comfortable |
147:   | Workspace/Agent | neutral | ascii | compact |
148:   | Phases/Life view | neutral | ridgeline | comfortable |
149:   | Settings/Onboarding | neutral | none | comfortable |
150: 
151: ## §11 DNA ELEMENTS (what makes every screen unmistakably RHEO)
152: - Mono kickers on every panel (`SECTION / NAME` pattern, from the landing).
153: - The rho-mark: About page + boot screen. **Boot = the mark draws itself
154:   once (900ms)** — "recording begins."
155: - The day-ruler motif from the landing IS the app's timeline scrubber.
156: - Phase chips, hairlines, tabular numerals everywhere. ◇ Insert the real
157:   feature vocabulary from the audit here.
158: 
159: ## §12 ANTI-SLOP BLACKLIST (instant rejection)
160: Decorative hue · chrome gradients · >2 font families · display font for
161: body copy · per-page bespoke shadows/radii/borders · glassmorphism/blur
162: panels · emoji icons · colored full-width sidebars/headers · neon glow
163: text · zebra stripes · bouncy overshoot on data elements · illustrations ·
164: any hex typed inside a component file · off-grid spacing · mixed icon sets.
